Z||000015||trigger||03-14-2001||08:40 PM||||I know what you mean 1fst2m6.  I was in Dubuque for hockey with mom's blazer when i saw one.  I was looking at the front thinking that sure looks familiar, but it had driving lights and extra parking light on the front.  I was still looking when i saw the back and recognized the taillights.  It was a darker color with a raised spoiler.  It was dark out so that was all I could see.  I had never seen it before.<P>P.S. wahoo4u where is peterson, iowa.  I live in Dyersville, Iowa which is 30 minutes west of Dubuque, Iowa.  I drive the red 88 coupe to school everyday.  See it at  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006162.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006162.html</A> <BR>e-mail me sometime.<P>P.P.S. I hate that blazer.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trigger.gif"> ||||reg||1
